<title>ESTONIA: Estonian mthly Dec trade gap rises to 2 bln kroons.</title>
<headline>Estonian mthly Dec trade gap rises to 2 bln kroons.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's monthly trade deficit rose to two billion kroons in December 1996 from 1.5 billion kroons the previous month, the statistics office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>All figures are billions of kroons.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN TRADE BALANCE     Dec '96     Nov '96     Dec '95</p>
<p> Exports			  2.3	   2.66	  1.81</p>
<p> Imports			  4.3	   4.16	  2.75</p>
<p> Balance			 -2.0	  -1.5	  -0.94</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
